0..75 Comment "// A source binds the old bare names of the identity and flow operations as"
76..94 Comment "// ordinary names."
95..97 Comment "//"
98..174 Comment "// The operations stand under their formers, `Path.here` and `Path.ap` among"
175..249 Comment "// them, so `here` and `cong` name nothing until a source declares them. A"
250..312 Comment "// library then keeps those short words for its own functions."
313..315 Comment "//"
316..393 Comment "// A call of such a name resolves to its binder, never to the operation under"
394..460 Comment "// the former, and the former\'s operation still answers beside it."
461..463 Comment "//"
464..544 Comment "// - see: `../../pathological/identity/bare-operations.gandr` — the bare names"
545..582 Comment "//   refused where nothing binds them"
